  user_input {
    user_response: "I want to build a mobile app for both Android and Apple phones, for customers to use to alert them to an upcoming Historical Marker as they drive using GPS location data, use text to speech to read the text on the marker plaque and provide photos of the site upon arrival.  The features should be toggled by the user for auto announce and show the marker and speak the text. and include a map view displaying nearby historical points of interest.  Also be able to choose the route and identify historical markers all along the route."
    items {
      text: "I want to build a mobile app for both Android and Apple phones, for customers to use to alert them to an upcoming Historical Marker as they drive using GPS location data, use text to speech to read the text on the marker plaque and provide photos of the site upon arrival.  The features should be toggled by the user for auto announce and show the marker and speak the text. and include a map view displaying nearby historical points of interest.  Also be able to choose the route and identify historical markers all along the route."
