          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "      \'Designed by pioneering architect Julia Morgan between 1919 and 1947 for publisher William Randolph Hearst. Combining Spanish Cathedral, Mediterranean Revival, and classical European treasures, this 127-acre estate hosted World leaders, Hollywood legends, and literary icons.\',"
