          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "      \'Rising abruptly over the Shenandoah Valley, these twin mountain peaks served as navigation beacons for Monacan Native Americans for over 8,000 years, and later marked Thomas Jefferson\\\'s favorite Blue Ridge mountain view in his 1781 Notes on the State of Virginia.\',"
