          text: "      \'Built between 1903 and 1914 by Ed Mabry, this gristmill, sawmill, and blacksmith shop served as the community gathering place for mountain residents for decades. The overshot waterwheel remains powered by native streamflow.\',"
          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
