          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_UNCHANGED
        }
        lines {
          text: "      \'Julia Morgan was the first woman admitted to the architecture program at the \303\211cole des Beaux-Arts in Paris and the first licensed female architect in California.\',"
