  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Natural Tones\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Natural Tones\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#fdfbf7] flex flex-row overflow-hidden font-sans text-[#332f2c]\'>\\n  <div class=\'w-[640px] h-full relative border-r border-[#e8e2d6] bg-[#e0e2d1]\'>\\n    <div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[radial-gradient(#5a5a40_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]\'></div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute top-8 left-8 z-10 w-64 p-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-[#d4cdc1]\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-[#b05b3b] mb-1\'>Current Route</div>\\n      <div class=\'text-lg font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>The Heritage Trail, PA</div>\\n      <div class=\'mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#7c756a]\'>\\n        <span>14.2 miles remaining</span>\\n        <span>3 markers ahead</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\'>\\n      <div class=\'relative\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-6 h-6 bg-[#b05b3b] rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg\'></div>\\n        <div class=\'absolute -top-12 -left-20 bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-[#d4cdc1] text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap\'>\\n          Approaching: Liberty Forge\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 h-48 bg-white/95 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-6 flex flex-row gap-6 border border-[#d4cdc1]\'>\\n      <div class=\'w-40 h-full bg-[#f5f2ed] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-center p-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'text-[32px] mb-2 opacity-30\'>\360\237\217\233\357\270\217</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7c756a]\'>Site Photo</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-2\'>\\n          <h2 class=\'text-2xl font-serif text-[#5a5a40]\'>Liberty Forge Plaque</h2>\\n          <span class=\'bg-[#eef1e6] text-[#5a5a40] text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\'>Active Discovery</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\'text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#6b645a] italic underline decoration-[#d4cdc1] underline-offset-4\'>\\n          Established in 1742, this forge produced cannonballs for the Continental Army under General Washington. The structure standing today was restored in 1894 by local stonemasons...\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\'mt-4 flex gap-3\'>\\n          <div class=\'h-1 w-full bg-[#e8e2d6] rounded-full overflow-hidden\'>\\n            <div class=\'h-full bg-[#b05b3b] w-[45%]\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-[#b05b3b]\'>01:24 / 03:10</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\'flex-1 h-full bg-[#f9f7f2] p-10 flex flex-col\'>\\n    <div class=\'mb-12\'>\\n      <h1 class=\'text-4xl font-serif font-light text-[#5a5a40] mb-2\'>Chronicle Roads</h1>\\n      <div class=\'h-[2px] w-12 bg-[#b05b3b]\'></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-8 flex-1\'>\\n      <div class=\'space-y-6\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\'text-sm font-semibold text-[#5a5a40]\'>Auto-Announce Audio</div>\\n            <div class=\'text-xs text-[#a39c91]\'>Read marker text via GPS proximity</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'w-12 h-6 bg-[#5a5a40] rounded-full relative\'>\\n            <div class=\'absolute right-1 top-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\'text-sm font-semibold text-[#5a5a40]\'>Visual Discovery</div>\\n            <div class=\'text-xs text-[#a39c91]\'>Pop up site photos upon arrival</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'w-12 h-6 bg-[#5a5a40] rounded-full relative\'>\\n            <div class=\'absolute right-1 top-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#b05b3b] mb-4\'>Nearby Markers</div>\\n        <div class=\'space-y-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 border-b border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>01</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>The Old Grist Mill</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>0.4 miles away \342\200\242 Route Preferred</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 border-b border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>02</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Stonemason\'s Cottage</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>1.1 miles away \342\200\242 On Route</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 opacity-60\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>03</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Blacksmith\'s Hollow</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>2.5 miles away \342\200\242 Exploring</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\'w-full py-4 bg-[#5a5a40] text-white rounded-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide shadow-lg hover:bg-[#4a4a35]\'>\\n        Modify Route Selection\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Natural Tones\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Natural Tones\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\'h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#fdfbf7] flex flex-row overflow-hidden font-sans text-[#332f2c]\'>\\n  <div class=\'w-[640px] h-full relative border-r border-[#e8e2d6] bg-[#e0e2d1]\'>\\n    <div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[radial-gradient(#5a5a40_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]\'></div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute top-8 left-8 z-10 w-64 p-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-[#d4cdc1]\'>\\n      <div class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-[#b05b3b] mb-1\'>Current Route</div>\\n      <div class=\'text-lg font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>The Heritage Trail, PA</div>\\n      <div class=\'mt-4 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-[#7c756a]\'>\\n        <span>14.2 miles remaining</span>\\n        <span>3 markers ahead</span>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\'>\\n      <div class=\'relative\'>\\n        <div class=\'w-6 h-6 bg-[#b05b3b] rounded-full border-4 border-white shadow-lg\'></div>\\n        <div class=\'absolute -top-12 -left-20 bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-md border border-[#d4cdc1] text-xs font-semibold whitespace-nowrap\'>\\n          Approaching: Liberty Forge\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'absolute bottom-8 left-8 right-8 h-48 bg-white/95 rounded-3xl shadow-2xl p-6 flex flex-row gap-6 border border-[#d4cdc1]\'>\\n      <div class=\'w-40 h-full bg-[#f5f2ed] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-center p-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'text-[32px] mb-2 opacity-30\'>\360\237\217\233\357\270\217</div>\\n          <div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#7c756a]\'>Site Photo</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex justify-between items-start mb-2\'>\\n          <h2 class=\'text-2xl font-serif text-[#5a5a40]\'>Liberty Forge Plaque</h2>\\n          <span class=\'bg-[#eef1e6] text-[#5a5a40] text-[10px] font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\'>Active Discovery</span>\\n        </div>\\n        <p class=\'text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#6b645a] italic underline decoration-[#d4cdc1] underline-offset-4\'>\\n          Established in 1742, this forge produced cannonballs for the Continental Army under General Washington. The structure standing today was restored in 1894 by local stonemasons...\\n        </p>\\n        <div class=\'mt-4 flex gap-3\'>\\n          <div class=\'h-1 w-full bg-[#e8e2d6] rounded-full overflow-hidden\'>\\n            <div class=\'h-full bg-[#b05b3b] w-[45%]\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n          <span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-[#b05b3b]\'>01:24 / 03:10</span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\'flex-1 h-full bg-[#f9f7f2] p-10 flex flex-col\'>\\n    <div class=\'mb-12\'>\\n      <h1 class=\'text-4xl font-serif font-light text-[#5a5a40] mb-2\'>Chronicle Roads</h1>\\n      <div class=\'h-[2px] w-12 bg-[#b05b3b]\'></div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\'flex flex-col gap-8 flex-1\'>\\n      <div class=\'space-y-6\'>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\'text-sm font-semibold text-[#5a5a40]\'>Auto-Announce Audio</div>\\n            <div class=\'text-xs text-[#a39c91]\'>Read marker text via GPS proximity</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'w-12 h-6 bg-[#5a5a40] rounded-full relative\'>\\n            <div class=\'absolute right-1 top-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n          <div>\\n            <div class=\'text-sm font-semibold text-[#5a5a40]\'>Visual Discovery</div>\\n            <div class=\'text-xs text-[#a39c91]\'>Pop up site photos upon arrival</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'w-12 h-6 bg-[#5a5a40] rounded-full relative\'>\\n            <div class=\'absolute right-1 top-1 w-4 h-4 bg-white rounded-full\'></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <div class=\'flex-1\'>\\n        <div class=\'text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#b05b3b] mb-4\'>Nearby Markers</div>\\n        <div class=\'space-y-4\'>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 border-b border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>01</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>The Old Grist Mill</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>0.4 miles away \342\200\242 Route Preferred</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 border-b border-[#e8e2d6]\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>02</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Stonemason\'s Cottage</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>1.1 miles away \342\200\242 On Route</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4 p-3 opacity-60\'>\\n            <div class=\'w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#f5f2ed] border border-[#d4cdc1] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-serif italic text-[#5a5a40]\'>03</div>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Blacksmith\'s Hollow</div>\\n              <div class=\'text-[10px] text-[#a39c91]\'>2.5 miles away \342\200\242 Exploring</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\'w-full py-4 bg-[#5a5a40] text-white rounded-2xl font-semibold tracking-wide shadow-lg hover:bg-[#4a4a35]\'>\\n        Modify Route Selection\\n      </button>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match t