          type: UNIFIED_DIFF_LINE_TYPE_INSERT
        }
        lines {
          text: "      \'Founded around 1735 by French Canadian settlers along the west bank of the Mississippi River, Ste. Genevieve preserves North America\\\'s highest concentration of French Colonial vertical-log \"poteaux-en-terre\" architecture, pre-dating the Louisiana Purchase.\',"
